@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@apiToken = replace-with-a-long-random-token

### Service metadata
GET {{host}}/
Accept: application/json

### Liveness probe
GET {{host}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness probe
GET {{host}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Start an agent session
POST {{host}}/api/v1/agent/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Create a Python function that validates an email address."
}

### Continue a session (replace the session ID)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/agent/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Now add unit tests.",
  "session_id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

